        id="f9e04690-4591-4797-9df9-744e955f3f8d" name="Operational Analysis" description="&lt;p>The problem space: an RF test laboratory evaluates the quality of the AIW 256-QAM link in hardware-in-the-loop tests.&lt;/p>">
